# Real letters and anything derived from them never leave the machine
private/*
!private/README.md
data/raw/
data/private/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.env
# per-environment names/policies (no secrets) are committed:
!config/*.env
local.settings.json

# Documents: only synthetic samples are tracked
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
!samples/synthetic/**
# Screenshots of synthetic/demo data only (Power BI demo household, watermarked synthetic letters).
